XM4N BLB4 GBLB CS4 CSB4 VDD GND tg
XI5 CS5 CSB5 VDD GND inv
XM5P BL5 GBL CS5 CSB5 VDD GND tg
XM5N BLB5 GBLB CS5 CSB5 VDD GND tg
.ENDS column_mux
.SUBCKT precharge BL0 BL1 BL2 BL3 BL4 BL5 BLB0 BLB1 BLB2 BLB3 BLB4 BLB5 PCB VDD GND
XP0 BL0 BLB0 PCB VDD GND precharge_unit
XP1 BL1 BLB1 PCB VDD GND precharge_unit
XP2 BL2 BLB2 PCB VDD GND precharge_unit
XP3 BL3 BLB3 PCB VDD GND precharge_unit
XP4 BL4 BLB4 PCB VDD GND precharge_unit
XP5 BL5 BLB5 PCB VDD GND precharge_unit
.ENDS precharge
.SUBCKT bitcell BL BL_bar WL Q Q_bar VDD GND
MPM0 Q_bar Q VDD VDD g45p1svt W=120n L=45n
