MNM3 BL WL Q GND g45n1svt W=240n L=45n
.ENDS bitcell
.SUBCKT bit_array WL0 WL1 WL2 WL3 BL0 BL1 BL2 BL3 BL4 BL5 BLB0 BLB1 BLB2 BLB3 BLB4 BLB5 VDD GND
