XB3_2 BL2 BLB2 WL3 Q3_2 QB3_2 VDD GND bitcell
XB3_3 BL3 BLB3 WL3 Q3_3 QB3_3 VDD GND bitcell
XB3_4 BL4 BLB4 WL3 Q3_4 QB3_4 VDD GND bitcell
