.ENDS bit_array
.SUBCKT sram_4x6 R1 R0 C2 C1 C0 CLK1 CLK2 WR RD DIN DOUT VDD GND
XCTRL CLK1 CLK2 WR RD C2 C1 WEN WENB REN RENB ROWEN PCB VDD GND rw_control
XROW R1 R0 ROWEN WL0 WL1 WL2 WL3 VDD GND row_decoder
XCOL C2 C1 C0 CS0 CS1 CS2 CS3 CS4 CS5 VDD GND column_decoder
XPRE BL0 BL1 BL2 BL3 BL4 BL5 BLB0 BLB1 BLB2 BLB3 BLB4 BLB5 PCB VDD GND precharge
XMUX CS0 CS1 CS2 CS3 CS4 CS5 BL0 BL1 BL2 BL3 BL4 BL5 BLB0 BLB1 BLB2 BLB3 BLB4 BLB5 GBL GBLB VDD GND column_mux
XWRITE DIN WEN WENB GBL GBLB VDD GND write_driver
XMEM WL0 WL1 WL2 WL3 BL0 BL1 BL2 BL3 BL4 BL5 BLB0 BLB1 BLB2 BLB3 BLB4 BLB5 VDD GND bit_array
XSENSE GBL GBLB REN VDD GND SENSE sense_amp
XLATCH SENSE REN RENB DOUT VDD GND read_latch
.ENDS sram_4x6
